category":"container","sourceLine":78},{"id":"std/Build/Step.zig:79:36388","name":"std.Build.Step.TopLevel.base_tag","anchor":"std.Build.Step.TopLevel.base_tag","category":"constant","sourceLine":79},{"id":"std/Build/Step.zig:74:36384","name":"std.Build.Step.TranslateC","anchor":"std.Build.Step.TranslateC","category":"alias","sourceLine":74},{"id":"std/Build/Step.zig:41:36371","name":"std.Build.Step.Type","anchor":"std.Build.Step.Type","category":"type-function","sourceLine":41},{"id":"std/Build/Step.zig:75:36385","name":"std.Build.Step.UpdateSourceFiles","anchor":"std.Build.Step.UpdateSourceFiles","category":"alias","sourceLine":75},{"id":"std/Build/Step.zig:76:36386","name":"std.Build.Step.WriteFile","anchor":"std.Build.Step.WriteFile","category":"alias","sourceLine":76}],"html":"<div id=\"std.Build.Step\"></div>\n<p class=\"api-source\" data-pagefind-ignore=\"\"><a href=\"#L1\">第 1 行</a></p>\n<h4>字段</h4><div class=\"api-fields\">\n<pre><code>tag: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Configuration/#std.Build.Configuration\">Configuration</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Configuration/#std.Build.Configuration.Step\">Step</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Configuration/#std.Build.Configuration.Step.Tag\">Tag</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>name: []<span class=\"tok-kw\">const</span> <span class=\"tok-type\">u8</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>owner: *<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/#std.Build\">Build</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>dependencies: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std.ArrayList\">ArrayList</a>(*<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/#std.Build.Step\">Step</a>)</code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"></div>\n<pre><code>max_rss: <span class=\"tok-type\">u64</span></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>设置此字段可声明执行该步骤所需内存字节数的\n上限。零表示不设限制。</p>\n<p>其目的是为可能占用大量内存的步骤\n标注上限。例如，某组单元测试可能需要 4\nGiB 内存，且将同时以四种不同的构建\n配置运行。若四个步骤同时执行，系统就可能需要\n16 GiB 内存，\n很容易超过实际可用内存，可能导致\n使用默认并发度执行 <code>zig build</code> 时系统崩溃。</p>\n<p>此字段使构建运行器执行两项操作：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>使用 ulimit 限制子进程，使其在超出该\n内存限制时失败。这也用于验证\n声明的上限值正确。</li>\n<li>确保任意时刻所有并发步骤的\nmax_rss 总和不超过构建运行器的 <code>max_total_rss</code>\n值。此值可通过命令行配置，默认为\n系统可用总内存。</li>\n</ol>\n</div>\n<pre><code>debug_stack_trace: <a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\">std</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/debug/#std.debug\">debug</a>.<a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/debug/#std.debug.StackTrace\">StackTrace</a></code></pre><div class=\"fieldDocs\"><p>与此步骤创建位置关联的返回地址，\n可与调试消息一起打印，辅助诊断。</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"api-members\"><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/#std.Build.Step\"><code>Step</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/#std\"><code>std</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/#std.Build\"><code>Build</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/debug/#std.debug.assert\"><code>assert</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Configuration/#std.Build.Configuration\"><code>Configuration</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Configuration/#std.Build.Configuration.Step.Tag\"><code>Tag</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/#std.Build.Step.Type\"><code>Type</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/CheckFile/#std.Build.Step.CheckFile\"><code>CheckFile</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/Compile/#std.Build.Step.Compile\"><code>Compile</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/ConfigHeader/#std.Build.Step.ConfigHeader\"><code>ConfigHeader</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/Fail/#std.Build.Step.Fail\"><code>Fail</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/FindProgram/#std.Build.Step.FindProgram\"><code>FindProgram</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/std/Build/Step/Fmt/#std.Build.Step.Fmt\"><code>Fmt</code></a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/zig-docs/zh-cn/